		{
			"id":"80cd929287f50491",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\n1. The Gemstone Cavern is unlocked through a special code sequence on the [[031 - Utility Closet.canvas|031 - Utility Closet]] V.A.C. Indicator buttons that reveals a hidden area inside the room.\n2. You can retrieve info about how it works on the [[024 - Office.canvas|024 - Office]] terminal emails and on the [[039 - Mail Room.canvas|039 - Mail Room]], on both rooms you can find information about how those buttons work and what is the expected sequence to unlock the hidden secret of this room.\n3. Turn V.A.C. Indicators on the correct pattern to open hidden room (only need to do this once per save)\n\t- Turn all indicators green by clicking on them\n\t- This allows you to turn things into blue\n\t- If you turn the dot besides a blue dot into something, it will turn purple\n\t- You can turn 5 dots into purple and then turn the final one into purple by clicking it\n\t- After that you are able to turn any of the dots into white\n\t- Then you need to set the correct pattern to open the hidden room switch\n\t\t- **Off - Blue - Green - White - Red - Purple**\n\t- The hidden room has a switch that opens the [[Gemstone Cavern.canvas|Gemstone Cavern]]\n4. This will give you a permanent starting bonus of two gems every run.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
